title: "BEK Online Coder: a browser codec for 3D Gaussian Splatting scenes"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Becchetti
    given-names: Sebastiano
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastianobecchetti/bek_online_coder"
url: "https://sebastianobecchetti.github.io/bek_online_coder/"
abstract: >-
  A TypeScript conversion of the BEK 3D Gaussian Splatting codec that encodes
  and decodes scenes entirely in the browser, verified byte-identical to the
  C++ reference implementation.
license: MIT
